{
  "id": 9393161961708,
  "title": "RUIPRO 8K Armored Full Fiber Optic HDMI 2.1 Cable, 48Gbps, 8K@60Hz / 4K@120Hz",
  "handle": "ruipro-8k-armored-full-fiber-optic-hdmi-2-1-cable",
  "description": "<p class=\"p\"><b><span>Key Features:</span></b><span>\u00a0</span><span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Supports up to 48Gbps bandwidth (12Gbps per channel \u00d7 4 channels), with resolutions up to 8K@60Hz and 4K@120Hz for home theater, gaming and professional AV applications.<span class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span>\n</li>\n<li>7-core OM3 full fiber optic construction (50/125 \u03bcm) provides stable long-distance audio and video transmission and is immune to electromagnetic interference (EMI).</li>\n<li>Durable armored construction provides enhanced tensile strength and compression resistance while maintaining flexibility for long-distance installations.</li>\n<li>Supports SDR, HDR, Dynamic HDR, HDR10+, Dolby Vision, ARC, eARC, VRR, ALLM, QFT, QMS and CEC.</li>\n<li>Supports 4:4:4 chroma and 10/12-bit color depth for detailed, high-quality video.</li>\n<li>Supports HDCP 1.4/2.2/2.3 and is compatible with PS5, Xbox Series X/S, PCs, Apple TV, Blu-ray players, TVs, projectors and AV receivers.</li>\n<li>Plug and play with no external drivers required.</li>\n<li>CE, RoHS and REACH certified.<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"p\"><b><span>Specifications:</span></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Limit bending radius: D30mm, 10 circles can work</li>\n<li>Power\u00a0Consumption: 280mW-600mW(max)</li>\n<li>Power Supply: 5V USB (USB power supply on the TX/source end is usually not needed, but the display end must be powered. Without power, the cable won't\u00a0 function.)</li>\n</ul>",
  "published_at": "2026-08-25T22:20:28+08:00",
